Modifications made in this fork, as required by section 4(b) of the license:
  - Added a fourth renderer, `model3d`, that mounts a skinned glTF model through a
    lazily-loaded three.js vendor bundle; added its manifest block,
    host-side entry resolution and MIME types.
  - Added the floating menu (appearance / accessories / interactions), the
    choreography editor, the 3D import pipeline and its offline/live guards.
  - Renamed the plugin id, route prefixes, locale namespace and page-level DOM
    markers so this fork can be installed alongside the upstream plugin.
  - Removed the upstream repository field; this fork is not the upstream project.
  - Dropped the upstream package mirror and its bundled pet assets. This
    repository ships plugin source only, plus a synthetic placeholder model
    generated by `tools/make-fixture-model.mjs`.

